			(property "Description" "ATECC608A CryptoAuthentication Device\n\n• Cryptographic Co-processor with Secure Hardware-Based Key Storage\n• ECDSA: FIPS186-3 Elliptic Curve Digital Signature Algorithm\n• ECDH: FIPS SP800-56A Elliptic Curve Diffie-Hellman Algorithm\n• AES Algorithm for encryption and decryption\n•  NIST Standard P256 Elliptic Curve Support\n• SHA-256 Hash Algorithm with HMAC Option\n• 1 MHz Standard I2C Interface\n• 2.0V to 5.5V Supply Voltage Range\n• 1.8V to 5.5V IO levels\n\nhttp://ww1.microchip.com/downloads/en/DeviceDoc/ATECC608A-CryptoAuthentication-Device-Summary-Data-Sheet-DS40001977B.pdf Datasheet (summary)\n\nSparkFun Products\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/18077 SparkFun Cryptographic Co-Processor Breakout - ATECC608A (Qwiic) (DEV-18077)"
